@JobTracker.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5073

GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# Job Applications CRUD

### List all job applications
GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/
Accept: application/json

###

### List job applications filtered by status
GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/?status=Interviewing
Accept: application/json

###

### Get job application by id
GET {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a job application
POST {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Acme Corp",
  "roleTitle": "Backend Engineer",
  "status": "Applied",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-20",
  "notes": "Referred by a friend"
}

###

### Create a job application with an empty Company (expect 400)
POST {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "",
  "roleTitle": "Backend Engineer",
  "status": "Applied",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-20",
  "notes": null
}

###

### Update a job application
PUT {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Acme Corp",
  "roleTitle": "Senior Backend Engineer",
  "status": "Interviewing",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-20",
  "notes": "Moved to interviewing"
}

###

### Delete a job application
DELETE {{JobTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/job-applications/1

###
